# ============================================================
# AXI Debug Hub - finish connection / address assignment
# Current BD: cpm_qdma_ep_part
#
# Confirmed actual objects:
#
#   PMC address space:
#     /versal_cips_0/PMC_NOC_AXI_0
#
#   Debug Hub segment:
#     /axi_dbg_hub_0/S_AXI_DBG_HUB/Mem0
